{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"相对单子"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"相对单子"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>在良好的情形中, 相对单子是 $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal J,\\mathcal C)$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"代入幺半结构","text":"代入幺半结构"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>通过 Kleisli 范畴</h3>\n<p>相对单子可通过其 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kleisli范畴","text":"Kleisli 范畴"}},{"Plain":"定义:</p>\n<p>todo</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>自由模</h3>\n<p>给定交换环 $R$, 自由模函子\n$$\r\n-\\otimes R\\colon \\mathsf{Fin}\\to\\mathsf{Set}\r\n$$\n是相对于 $\\mathsf{Fin}\\hookrightarrow\\mathsf{Set}$ 的单子.</p>\n"}]}}